<title>UK: KfW sets 10 billion escudos 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 10 billion escudos 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios Portugal and Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTE    BASE	*3M-LISBOR MATURITY    10 YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *6 BP	PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  **	  LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	*CAPPED AT 9.0 PERCENT</p>
<p>	     **THE ISSUE PRICE WAS NOT IMMEDIATELY AVAILABLE</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
